<title>USA: Bank of New York named master trustee of plan.</title>
<headline>Bank of New York named master trustee of plan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of New York Co Inc on Tuesday said it was appointed master trustee of Phillips Petroleum Co's $750 million retirement income plan.</p>
<p>The previous master trustee was NationsBank Corp, a spokesman said. The conversion is scheduled to be completed by August 1.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
